  "result": {
    "observation": "On this machine and these workloads, a threshold of 128 selects layer-major prefill too early. At 128 tokens, its median TTFT is 2.84 times the threshold-1024 result.",
    "tradeoff": "Layer-major prefill lowers peak MLX memory but reads substantially more expert data for short prompts.",
    "recommendation": "Do not use 128 as the general default based on this evidence. Keep 1024 until a wider workload sweep identifies a crossover point.",
